    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="0903" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg791"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/2253</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Fletcher</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1692</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 31, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: For the information of the Department I
                    have the honor to transmit herewith a copy of my note No. 823 of December 28,
                    1918, to the Mexican Foreign Office, which note was sent in compliance <pb
                        facs="0904" n="792" xml:id="pg792"/> with the Department’s instruction No.
                    799 of December 13.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d689-f1"/> There is also enclosed a
                    copy of my note No. 824 of December 28, to the Mexican Foreign Office, which was
                    sent at the same time as the note above referred to and based on the
                    Department’s telegraphic instruction No. 1752, of December 27, 5 p.m., and my
                    telegram No. 1860, of December 26, at 2 p.m. Both of these notes refer to the
                    petroleum decrees.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry P. Fletcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d689-a1.xml" xpointer="d689-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d689-f1" n="1" xml:id="d689-f1-content">
